p_{1}(x,\xi)\\
\vdots\\
p_{M}(x,\xi)\\
f_{1}(W_{1}\xi)\\
\vdots\\
f_{M}(W_{M}\xi)\end{array}\right]^{\top}\tilde{Q}\left[\begin{array}[]{c}\xi\\
p_{1}(x,\xi)\\
\vdots\\
p_{M}(x,\xi)\\
f_{1}(W_{1}\xi)\\
\vdots\\
f_{M}(W_{M}\xi)\end{array}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
