<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table D.2: </span>Tasks Summary. Rob: number of robots. Obj: number of objects. ActD: action dimension. PH: proficient-human demonstration. Steps: max number of rollout steps. Franka Kitchen and Robomimic involve 6D robot and gripper actions in the joint space. Push-T focuses on robot end-effector trajectories.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
